<title>HONG KONG: HK Weather - cloudy, misty with rain, max 22 C.</title>
<headline>HK Weather - cloudy, misty with rain, max 22 C.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong can expect cloudy and misty weather with rain patches on Monday, the Royal Observatory said.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m. the temperature was 20 C and the relative humidity 92 percent. The maximum temperature will reach about 22 C.</p>
<p>Outlook for Tuesday: fog patches at first, some rain later.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
